ios-redfin bridge patch 0136: port of UniXNU AdrenoMetal bridge/patches/0015-two-plane-shadow-as-memory-lies.patch
Original author: bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com> (UniXNU/AdrenoMetal ce5e19e, BSD-2-Clause-Patent).
Ported onto metal2vulkan 720ef1ce + ios-redfin bridge patches 0001-0111 for the redfin port; changes from the original are
marked 'ios-on-pixel (bridge 0136)'. Knob: SWEET_U0015=1 (default off: the image is zeroed first).
See phone/metal2/bridge/UNIXNU-PORT.md.

